    {
      "id": "A1-06-l2",
      "position": 2,
      "skill": "grammar",
      "title": "have / has + الجمع",
      "est_minutes": 30,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "markdown_ar": "نستخدم **have** و **has** بمعنى «عنده / يملك»:\n\n- **I, you, we, they** + **have**: I **have** a cat. / They **have** goats.\n- **he, she, it** + **has**: He **has** a camel. / My aunt **has** a farm.\n\n**النفي:** don't have / doesn't have: «We **don't have** a cow.» «She **doesn't have** a cat.»\n\n**السؤال:** Do you have…? / Does he have…? ← Yes, I do. / No, he doesn't."
        },
        {
