        {
          "type": "audio",
          "text_en": "Rami: Do you have animals at home, Majed?\nMajed: Yes, we do. We live in a village near Seiyun. We have six goats and ten chickens.\nRami: Do you have a camel?\nMajed: No, we don't. But my grandfather has two camels. He lives in the desert near Thamud.\nRami: Wow! I live in Mukalla. We don't have goats, but we have a cat. Her name is Lulu.\nMajed: Do you go to the sea?\nRami: Yes. In spring, we sometimes see big turtles on the beach at Sharma.\nMajed: Turtles? That's amazing!"
        },
